```
position:absolute;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acid);box-shadow:0 0 10px;animation:duelBlip 2.4s infinite;
i:nth-child(1){left:63%;top:28%;animation-delay:.2s}
...
```
Note radar `b` center plus 4 i. Great.

