.duel-versus-mark span{width:32px;height:32px;font-size:8px}
.duel-versus-mark i{height:16px}
.duel-versus-card{padding:8px 6px}
.duel-versus-card canvas{height:84px}
.duel-versus-card .eyebrow{font-size:5.5px}
.duel-versus-card strong{font-size:14px}
.duel-versus-card small{font-size:5.5px}
.duel-versus-stance{font-size:5px;padding:3px 4px}
.duel-found-banner{gap:6px;font-size:6px;padding:6px 8px}
.duel-found-banner small{display:none}
```
