Also at 820 `.duel-match` has base `.duel-room` overflow-y auto; and match stage min height 0. Search content maybe scroll? Match stage is row 1fr and no internal scroll; at very short heights it could clip. At 390x844 fine. We can set `.duel-match-stage{overflow-y:auto}` at <=820 to allow. But stage has :before/:after absolute, content grid height 100%; if overflow auto and content taller, okay. Add `overflow-y:auto` at 820. Yet the pseudo-elements fixed to stage, fine. Let's do.

